## AI C port update

I used AI to port this version of Hyper Match 3D from JavaScript to C, with the help of the [tela.c library](https://github.com/pedroth/tela.c). I was impressed! With just a few prompts in VSCode, it produced a much faster version of the game, which you can find in the [Hyper Match 3D C repository](https://github.com/pedroth/hyper-match-3d.c). 

At the same internal resolution of `640x480`, check out the results for yourself:

